Z||000000||beer_stud_21||02-04-2001||06:09 PM||||Well, she ain't exactly pretty, but meet <B>Marla</B>..  I towed her home last night for $300.00   She's been sitting for about 4 years and has a distributor problem keeping her from starting up. Also the calipers need re-surfacing and the drivers side headlight doesn't come up.  Other than that just a lot of little stuff.  If anyone has suggestions as far as my dist problem goes I'm always listening.  I named her Marla after Marla Singer from Fight Club because when I was looking at her yesterday I noticed that she really needed a good wash!<P>For anyone insterested here are some pics.  85GT auto  OD reads 70268mi.  I've had her since 6 o clock last night.<P><A HREF="http://www.curlykoa.com/Marla/" TARGET=_blank>Click to see pictures of Marla</A><P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">Marlin <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P><BR>fixed url!<BR><p>[This message has been edited by beer_stud_21 (edited 02-04-2001).]||||reg||10
