Z||000012||Voytek||02-05-2001||02:12 PM||||Does Marla not start at all?  Had a couple problems on my GT.  If no start but turns over (code 12 - no signal), chances are it's the chip in the distributor (had to change it twice on my 4 banger and twice on my GT).  Sometimes the car would run and then quit when it got warm.  Sometimes it would die with no warning.  The chip's a good bet.  The other one is the pick-up coil (Jimig is right).  They do tend to corrode out completely.  Not that hard to change - just make sure you mark the position of the distributor.  I've changed mine without damaging anything and runs great.||||reg||1
